      <data key="label">WC-O Optimiser Quality Gates (O1–O4)</data>
      <data key="type">Decision</data>
      <data key="summary">Calibration metrics, auto binary/ternary/skip policy, drop-in honesty thresholds, and short QAT vs cold PTQ — ROADMAP §1.3. Partial on main; Lane A PR #19 hardens — do not claim WC-O closed until integrator merges.</data>
